sioned by Süleyman I's consort, Hürrem Sultan, and completed in 1556 on the site of the historical Baths of Zeuxippus for the religious community of the nearby Hagia Sophia. Outside Istanbul, Sinan also ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hammam\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... She starred in the TV series \\\"The Magnificent Century\\\", where she played the daughter of a grown daughter and Hürrem Suleiman.\\n\\n11. Melike Ipek Yalova (born 1984, Ankara, Turkey) - a model, a Turkish actress who became world famous for her role as Isabella in the series \\\"The Magnificent ... \",\"title\":\"https://beauty-around.com/en/tops/item/60-samyue-krasivyie-turkey-actress\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d66\"},\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... Muhteşem Yüzyıl\\n\\n[edit]The Magnificent Century (often internationally aired under titles bearing variations of Suleiman or Hurrem) was originally released 2011–2014. If any Turkish series can be argued to have a cult following, it is probably this one.\\n\\nIt was taken in a set, which emulated the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Turkish_TV_series_tourism\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d129\"},\"ref\":\"d129\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ottoman period (1517–1917)\\n\\nDuring the Ottoman period, the reign of Suleiman the Magnificent () brought Ottoman dynastic patronage to the city, around the same time that the sultan and his wife, Haseki Hürrem Sultan (Roxelana), were also commissioning works in the holy cities of Mecca and Medina. Suleiman ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dome_of_the_Rock\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d130\"},\"ref\":\"d130\",\"snippet\":\" ... Monuments constructed during the reign of Suleiman the Magnificent especially those constructed by Mimar Sinan gave the city a brand new look. Süleymaniye Mosque and Complex, Şehzadebaşı Mosque and Complex, Sultan Selim Mosque and Complex, Mihrimah Sultan Mosque, Haseki Complex and Haseki Bath constructed for Hürrem Sultan were ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.fatih.bel.tr/en/main/pages/fatih-in-history/573\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d131\"},\"ref\":\"d131\",\"snippet\":\" ... According to historical sources, after the events at Čukur-česma in 1862, when a conflict between Turks and Serbs escalated, the Turks fled with their wives and children to the mosque on Liman. It is believed that the mosque on Liman was exactly on the site of today ... \",\"title\":\"https://beotura.rs/en/nestale-dzamije/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d132\"},\"ref\":\"d132\",\"snippet\":\" ... He eventually restored the Han dynasty.\\n* Hurrem Sultan, also known as Roxelana, was the chief consort and legal wife of the Ottoman Sultan Suleiman the Magnificent. She became one of the most powerful and influential women in Ottoman history and a prominent and controversial figure during the era ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rags_to_riches\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"ec7743632b979c10577023c0b6c0c6f9345cd9cc5ee1355ec3a2b666618f12a0\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"893c403b52fdd21174